        70.86609649658203,
        607.745849609375,
        162.0601043701172,
        621.8338012695312
      ],
      "text": "against an MRS?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-MdIt",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        632.500732421875,
        526.6039428710938,
        645.645751953125
      ],
      "text": "Fifteen studies (3024 participants) evaluating sputum were identified, with sensitivities ranging",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.963689804077148,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        648.000732421875,
        526.939697265625,
        661.145751953125
      ],
      "text": "between 57% and 91% and specificities between 82% and 100% ( ). Eleven studies  Fig. 2.3.2.2",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98483943939209,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        663.500732421875,
        526.9700927734375,
        676.645751953125
      ],
      "text": "(2990 participants) were included in the meta-analysis. The summary sensitivity was 75.3%",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        679.000732421875,
        526.7898559570312,
        692.145751953125
      ],
      "text": "(95% CI: 68.9–80.8) and summary specificity was 95.9% (95% CI: 92.3–97.9). Certainty of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        694.500732421875,
        524.412353515625,
        707.645751953125
      ],
      "text": "evidence was high for both sensitivity and specificity. The data on Truenat MTB Plus and MTB-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
